    "detailed_description": "This time you will get to discover many murder stories, meet many people \u2013 good, bad, just minding their own business, meet new friends and change the story by making your own choices! There are many exciting adventures waiting for you in each part of our new game series! Death, love, hate, mysteries - you have to deal with all of this, solving numerous puzzles along the way and searching for items, playing your favorite hidden object scenes! Gather your wits for an unforgettable detective story in this pulse-pounded new Hidden-Object Puzzle Adventure!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis Collector's Edition includes: <br />\r\n<br />\r\nMake choices and change and choose your end of the story!<br />\r\nPlay and re-play your favorite puzzles and mini-games to earn a variety of achievements!<br />\r\nEnjoy bonus materials!<br />\r\nKeep an eye out for different collectibles!",
    "about_the_game": "This time you will get to discover many murder stories, meet many people \u2013 good, bad, just minding their own business, meet new friends and change the story by making your own choices! There are many exciting adventures waiting for you in each part of our new game series! Death, love, hate, mysteries - you have to deal with all of this, solving numerous puzzles along the way and searching for items, playing your favorite hidden object scenes! Gather your wits for an unforgettable detective story in this pulse-pounded new Hidden-Object Puzzle Adventure!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis Collector's Edition includes: <br />\r\n<br />\r\nMake choices and change and choose your end of the story!<br />\r\nPlay and re-play your favorite puzzles and mini-games to earn a variety of achievements!<br />\r\nEnjoy bonus materials!<br />\r\nKeep an eye out for different collectibles!",
    "short_description": "Solve a series of tough cases, full of personal drama! In the new game series, you have to unravel some of the hardest mysteries using both logic and your intuition!",
